Waiting on an answer from Tim Zeppieri on if disapproving the VREQ RM192-0040 and having it re-routed or if using the new EBPN and having everyone that uses the LPT update to the new EBPN is a better route.

We assume disapproving the VREQ is the better answer but want to confirm that using the new EBPN would be easy/lack significant downstream affects;;;

