15/Dec/25 9:27 AM;aly;- Beginning work on the updates to the motor model to create variant blocks that are aligned with how the servo valve models were made/updated.
- Steps taken were mostly to make a more general model of the motors first as a top level model, and then make the "innards". Started w/ the simple version since I think will probably need MathWorks assistance w/ the complex model.
- Also needed to update some of the parameters of the motor itself, seems like some of the values were referenced improperly and didnt belong to the portion of the model it was assigned to.;;;

